---
title: How to split a PDF for free
description: Extract pages or divide a PDF into multiple files — private, in-browser.
relatedTool: split-pdf
---

Split one PDF into separate documents or pull out specific page ranges.

## Steps

1. Open **Split PDF** on WeLovePDF.
2. Upload your PDF.
3. Choose a mode:
   - **Extract pages** — pick ranges like `1-3, 5, 8-10`
   - **Split every N pages** — automatic chunks
   - **Split into single pages** — one file per page
4. Click **Split PDF** and download a ZIP of results.

## Tips

> **Info:** Password-protected PDFs must be unlocked first using **Unlock PDF**.

- Page ranges use comma-separated segments (`1-3, 5`).
- Large documents may take longer — processing stays local.

## Related

- [Merge PDF](/guides/merge-pdf-free) — combine split parts again
- [Organize PDF](/tools/organize-pdf) — reorder or delete pages visually
